                            <comment id="496696" author="gerrit" created="Wed, 24 Jun 2026 03:56:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&quot;Chris Horn &amp;lt;chorn@ddn.com&amp;gt;&quot; uploaded a new patch: &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66829&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66829&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
